  - THREE DOCTRINE TESTS ON A JUDGE'S ANSWER CHECK LINE GRADED MEETS (pkgKDA rev 3, ASKs 301, 302 and 303; Shared Library kagLines2024, in Panel Payloads, Alternate Payloads and R2 Alternate Payloads):
